        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 115173,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Supponiamo di voler trovare determinati elementi che soddisfano una condizione specificata ed estrarli in un nuovo array.</p><p>Un modo per farlo è usare un ciclo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element \" /><text value=\"of\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  arr.push(element);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[ 95, 90 ]\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Calling .filter on an Array",
            "id": 115174,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Invece, possiamo usare la funzione <code>.filter()</code>. <code>.filter()</code> crea un nuovo array con i valori che soddisfano una condizione.</p><p><code>.filter()</code> usa la sintassi: <code>ArrayName.filter()</code>. Chiamiamolo sull'array <code>testScores</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".map()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>testScores</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>filter</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Invece, possiamo usare la funzione <code>.filter()</code>. <code>.filter()</code> crea un nuovo array con i valori che soddisfano una condizione.</p><p>Crea <code>arr</code> chiamando il metodo che mantiene i punteggi corrispondenti, anziché quello che trasforma ogni punteggio.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"map\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"reduce\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"forEach\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>testScores</code>, seguito da <code>.</code>, <code>filter</code>, <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Passing Functions",
            "id": 115175,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per indicare alla funzione <code>.filter()</code> se includere o escludere un valore nel nuovo array, devi passare una funzione come parametro.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>function</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per indicare alla funzione <code>.filter()</code> se includere o escludere un valore nel nuovo array, devi passare una funzione come parametro.</p><p>Prepara <code>arr</code> a decidere su ogni punteggio aggiungendo una callback inline vuota all'interno di <code>.filter()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>function</code>, seguito da <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>{</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Parameters",
            "id": 115177,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dobbiamo dare alla funzione inline accesso agli elementi dell'array.</p><p>Per farlo, aggiungiamo semplicemente un parametro alla funzione. In questo caso useremo <code>element</code>, ma va bene qualsiasi nome.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" participants = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ben&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Eli&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Henry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sean&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Annabel&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sNames = participants.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] === \" /><text value=\"&quot;S&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(sNames);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"125\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Sarah', 'Sean' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>element</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Return",
            "id": 115176,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per indicare alla funzione <code>.filter()</code> quali valori memorizzare nel nuovo array, l'istruzione <code>return</code> della funzione deve restituire un valore booleano.</p><p>Di solito scriviamo una condizione che coinvolge l'elemento o l'indice dell'array e che restituisce un valore booleano.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"arr\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 95, 90 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return</code>, seguito da <code>element &gt;= 90</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.filter()</code> crea un nuovo array. La sua funzione inline riceve ogni valore e restituisce <code>true</code> per mantenerlo.</p><p>Per indicare alla funzione <code>.filter()</code> quali valori memorizzare nel nuovo array, l'istruzione <code>return</code> della funzione deve restituire un valore booleano.</p><p>Mantieni solo i punteggi di almeno <code>90</code>, poi stampa l'array filtrato.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option startIndex=\"114\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"testScores\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 95, 90 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>element</code>, seguito da <code>return</code>, <code>&gt;=</code> e infine <code>90</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Parameters II",
            "id": 115178,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se includiamo un secondo parametro nella funzione <code>filter()</code>, possiamo accedere all'indice di ogni iterazione insieme al valore dell'array.</p><p>In questo esempio chiameremo il parametro <code>index</code>, ma puoi usare qualsiasi nome.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" week = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sunday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Monday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tuesday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Wednesday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Thursday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Friday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Saturday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" workWeek = week.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (index &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &amp;&amp; index &lt; \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(workWeek);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"140\" endIndex=\"145\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Monday', 'Tuesday', 'Wednesday', 'Thursday', 'Friday' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>index</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Arrow functions",
            "id": 115180,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per semplificare la sintassi, possiamo usare una funzione freccia JavaScript al posto della funzione inline.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 95, 90 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>element</code>, seguito da <code>=&gt;</code> e infine <code>element &gt;= 90</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per semplificare la sintassi, possiamo usare una funzione freccia JavaScript al posto della funzione inline.</p><p>Usa questa sintassi di callback più breve per mantenere i punteggi di almeno <code>90</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 95, 90 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>90</code>, seguito da <code>=&gt;</code>, <code>element</code> e infine <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Intro",
            "id": 115276,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale funzione JavaScript possiamo usare per creare un nuovo array di elementi che soddisfano una condizione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.filter()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.map()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>.filter()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale metodo crea un nuovo array di elementi che soddisfano una condizione, quando vuoi solo i punteggi sufficienti?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.filter()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.map()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>.forEach()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>.filter()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Passing Functions",
            "id": 115278,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa dobbiamo passare come parametro per dire alla funzione <code>.filter()</code> quali valori includere nel nuovo array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una funzione</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo un'istruzione condizionale</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una funzione.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>All'interno di <code>.filter()</code>, cosa riceve ogni valore dell'array per decidere se mantenerlo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una funzione</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo un'istruzione condizionale</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Un nuovo array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Una funzione.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Parameters",
            "id": 115279,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come possiamo passare i valori dell'array alla funzione inline <code>.filter()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aggiungendo un parametro alla funzione inline</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Aggiungendo il secondo parametro obbligatorio alla funzione inline</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aggiungendo un parametro alla funzione inline.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esegui <code>[80, 95].filter(function(score) { return score &gt;= 90; })</code>.</p><p>Quale valore riceve <code>score</code> alla prima chiamata della funzione inline?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>80</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">L'intero array <code>[80, 95]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>80</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Parameters II",
            "id": 115280,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa possiamo accedere includendo un secondo parametro nella funzione inline di <code>.filter()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">L'indice corrente nell'iterazione</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">L'array chiamato</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">L'indice corrente nell'iterazione.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In <code>items.filter((item, index) =&gt; ...)</code>, quale valore rappresenta <code>index</code> durante l'esecuzione della callback?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">L'indice corrente nell'iterazione</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">L'array chiamato</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il valore memorizzato in <code>item</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">L'indice corrente nell'iterazione.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Return",
            "id": 115281,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che tipo di valore restituisce la funzione inline di <code>.filter()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un valore booleano</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una stringa</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un valore booleano.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Affinché un valore rimanga nell'array restituito da <code>.filter()</code>, cosa deve restituire la sua callback?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un valore booleano</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una stringa</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">L'elemento stesso dell'array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Un valore booleano.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Arrow functions",
            "id": 115282,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché potremmo usare una funzione freccia al posto di una funzione inline?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Perché una arrow function semplifica la sintassi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Perché una arrow function non ha bisogno di parametri</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Perché una arrow function semplifica la sintassi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché <code>score =&gt; score &gt;= 90</code> può sostituire una funzione inline più lunga in una callback di filter?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Perché una arrow function semplifica la sintassi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Perché una arrow function non ha bisogno di parametri</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Perché una arrow function restituisce sempre un array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Perché una arrow function semplifica la sintassi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Calling .filter on an Array",
            "id": 115285,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama la funzione <code>.filter()</code> sull'array <code>names</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" names = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tony&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tania&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Vince&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Terry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = names.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" (element[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] === \" /><text value=\"&quot;T&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"map\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tony', 'Tania', 'Terry' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>names</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>filter</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea un array contenente solo i nomi che iniziano con <code>\"T\"</code>, quindi visualizzalo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" names = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tony&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tania&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Vince&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Terry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = names.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" (element[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] === \" /><text value=\"&quot;T&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"map\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Vince\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tony', 'Tania', 'Terry' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>names</code>, seguito da <code>filter</code>, <code>element</code>, <code>===</code> e infine <code>\"T\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Passing Functions",
            "id": 115286,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi una funzione inline all'interno della funzione <code>.filter()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" customerTotals = [\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"56\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"78\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"110\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" largeOrder = customerTotals.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>function</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Parameters",
            "id": 115287,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi il parametro appropriato per consentire alla funzione inline di accedere ai valori dell'array.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices = [\" /><text value=\"19.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"18.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"21.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inBudget = prices.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"price\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price &lt; \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inBudget);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"97\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 19.99, 18.99, 17.99 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>price</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Return",
            "id": 115289,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi la parola chiave corretta in modo che la funzione <code>.filter()</code> popoli l'array <code>shortSleeveDay</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" weather = [\" /><text value=\"67\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"78\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"73\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"77\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"82\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"93\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shortSleeveDay = weather.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temp &gt; \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(shortSleeveDay);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"104\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 78, 77, 82, 93 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Parameters II",
            "id": 115288,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica i parametri nell'ordine corretto in modo che <code>top3</code> memorizzi i primi tre <code>finishers</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finishers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sally&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jake&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" top3 = finishers.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"finisher, place\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" place &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(top3);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"110\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Sarah', 'Sally', 'Jake' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>finisher</code>, seguito da <code>,</code> e infine <code>place</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il secondo parametro inline riceve ogni indice, a partire da <code>0</code>. Assegna al primo parametro il nome <code>finisher</code>.</p><p>Mantieni i primi tre arrivati controllando la posizione di ciascuno, poi stampa <code>top3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finishers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sally&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jake&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" top3 = finishers.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"finisher, place\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" place &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(top3);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"128\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option startIndex=\"134\" endIndex=\"135\" /><option startIndex=\"136\" endIndex=\"137\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"index\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"finishers\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Sarah', 'Sally', 'Jake' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>finisher</code>, seguito da <code>place</code>, <code>&lt;</code> e infine <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Arrow functions",
            "id": 115290,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi una arrow function che restituisca <code>true</code> se l'indice dell'elemento è minore di 3.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finishers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sally&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jake&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" top3 = \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" finishers.filter(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"finisher, place\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" place &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(top3);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"120\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"124\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"111\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Sarah', 'Sally', 'Jake' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(finisher, place)</code>, seguito da <code>=&gt;</code> e poi <code>place</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Racchiudi tra parentesi più parametri di una arrow function, come <code>(finisher, place)</code>.</p><p>Usa una arrow function per mantenere i primi tre arrivati e stampa <code>top3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finishers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sally&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jake&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" top3 = \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" finishers.filter(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"finisher, place\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" place &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(top3);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"120\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"124\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"index\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Sarah', 'Sally', 'Jake' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(finisher, place)</code>, seguito da <code>=&gt;</code>, <code>place</code>, <code>&lt;</code> e infine <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          }
        ]
